Isabel uploaded a total of 25 pictures. She placed 10 pictures into one album, leaving $25 - 10 = 15$ pictures. These 15 pictures were distributed equally into 5 different albums. To find the number of pictures in each of these albums, divide 15 by 5: 

$$
\frac{15}{5} = 3
$$

Thus, each of the 5 albums contains $\boxed{3}$ pictures. 
\boxed{3}  
