Now, he had only washed 20 of them by the time school started. The question is asking how many he did not wash. So, I think I need to subtract the number of shirts he washed from the total number of shirts. That would be 36 minus 20. Let me do that subtraction. 36 minus 20 is 16. So, he did not wash 16 shirts. 

