$$

This means that 7 members showed up for the game.

Next, since each of the 7 members who showed up scored 5 points, the total points scored can be calculated by multiplying the number of members who showed up by the points each member scored:

$$
7 \times 5 = 35
$$

Thus, the total points scored during the game were:

$$
\boxed{35}
$$

The number of members that showed up for the game is 7. 

